|<span style="color:#FF496C">Please ensure that your images are uploaded in PNG or WEBP format, appropriately named, and correctly categorized and licensed.</span> For more details, refer [[meta:Help:How to upload files and choosing the right license|here]].
|-
|To include a file in a page, use a link in one of the following forms:
* <strong><code><nowiki>[[</nowiki>File<nowiki>:File.png]]</nowiki></code></strong> or <strong><code><nowiki>[[</nowiki>File<nowiki>:File.webp]]</nowiki></code></strong> to use the full version of the file
* <strong><code><nowiki>[[</nowiki>File<nowiki>:File.png|200px|thumb|left|alt text]]</nowiki></code></strong> or <strong><code><nowiki>[[</nowiki>File<nowiki>:File.webp|200px|thumb|left|alt text]]</nowiki></code></strong> to use a 200 pixel wide rendition in a box in the left margin with "alt text" as description
* <strong><code><nowiki>[[</nowiki>Media<nowiki>:File.png]]</nowiki></code></strong> or <strong><code><nowiki>[[</nowiki>Media<nowiki>:File.webp]]</nowiki></code></strong> for directly linking to the file without displaying the file
